    {
      "note": "The ASV's frame *meet for … use* renders the single adjective, discontinuously under rule 15. Head on *use* as the χρησ- stem word, as rule 104 heads εὐπειθής on *entreated*; heading on *meet* is defensible. *for* is not read as the dative's case preposition, since it governs the frame's *use* and not *master's*.",
